# ── 发布包排除（§16.8；与 .clawhubignore 双平台对齐）────────────────
# 测试 / 缓存 / 中间产物不进包
tests/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.db
out/
*.log
.Rhistory
.RData
staging/

# 本地凭据不进包（README 承诺：仅 .env.example 随包发布；用户自行配置 key）
.env

# 用户自定义检索词扩展（README 承诺 git-ignored，随包公开会泄漏用户词库）
references/user_terms.json

# coze 工作流代码包镜像（私有端点源码，§16.7 双平台排除）
adapters/coze/

# publish_inject 注入副产物（§16.8：注入时自动备份被覆盖文件 + 写入 .ctbase_injected.json 清单，
# 含本机绝对路径，不随发布包公开）
.ctbase_injected.json
*.ctbase_bak_*

# 作者侧批量维护脚本（不属技能运行部件，不随包发布）
tools/
adapters/_smoke_guidelines.py

# ── Full-text guideline documents are the author's curated IP and MUST NOT ship with
# this skill. The builder writes them to an EXTERNAL cache by default
# (~/.workbuddy/ct-guideline-docs), never under references/guidelines/. These lines are
# defense-in-depth in case someone overrides --doc-cache-dir to live inside the skill tree.
# The pointer index (guidelines_index.json) is intentionally NOT ignored — it is the skill's data.
references/guidelines/docs/
references/guidelines/**/*.pdf
references/guidelines/**/*.xml
references/guidelines/**/*.html
ct-guideline-docs/

# ── ct-base 统一基线（§16.7 / §16.8，2026-08-29 全库回填）──
*.env
.env.*
*.key
*.secret
*.token
secrets.json
credentials.json
config.local.json
out_live/
outputs/
*.cache
adapters/coze_project/
**/coze_contract.md
**/refiner_contract.md
**/coze_system_prompt_v*.md
**/ops.md
scripts/tests/

pdfs/

# ── 工作台整体排除（2026-09-07 由 *.html 扩为整目录，§16.7 ③）──
# 本地 Web 操作界面 + 内部审计/bugreport 资产（_bugreports 等），暂不发布；
# ClawHub 按目录打包不认 git 跟踪，仅排 *.html 会把内部资产带进发布包
workbench/

# ── 补齐双份 ignore 差异项（2026-08-29）──
*.py[cod]
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.so
*.egg-info/

# ── 运行态配置 / 检索产物（2026-09-06 起移出技能树，置 ~/.workbuddy/ct-literature-runtime/）──
config/
out_dm_sglt2_v9/
